    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players will join forces to face increasingly powerful waves of enemies. The goal is to survive all the waves, improve your heroes and their abilities, and protect your nexus. Cooperation will be essential, as each player must strategically use their resources and skills to overcome the challenges that arise.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Competitive mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to cooperative defense, you can face off against your friends using offensive abilities and trying to outlast your rivals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variety of heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of heroes, each with unique abilities that you can improve as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades and customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your heroes and equipment, adapting to the enemies with powerful abilities and upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly challenging waves of monsters as you progress, ensuring constant action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with your teammates, plan the best tactics, and defeat the toughest waves.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players will join forces to face increasingly powerful waves of enemies. The goal is to survive all the waves, improve your heroes and their abilities, and protect your nexus. Cooperation will be essential, as each player must strategically use their resources and skills to overcome the challenges that arise.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Competitive mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to cooperative defense, you can face off against your friends using offensive abilities and trying to outlast your rivals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variety of heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of heroes, each with unique abilities that you can improve as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades and customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your heroes and equipment, adapting to the enemies with powerful abilities and upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly challenging waves of monsters as you progress, ensuring constant action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with your teammates, plan the best tactics, and defeat the toughest waves.</p>",
    "short_description": "Face challenging waves of monsters solo or with your team! You and your team must fight to defend your nexus and survive increasingly powerful waves of enemies. Choose from a variety of heroes, upgrade their powers and gear as you progress, and adapt to each challenge.",
